# Never send local dependencies/build output/VCS history into the build context —
# without this, `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` inside the image collides with a
# copied-in node_modules and fails (no TTY to confirm purging it).
node_modules
**/node_modules

.git
.next
**/.next
dist
coverage
out
outputs
work

*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.production.example

db/local-data
scripts/*.png
*.tsbuildinfo

# Not needed to build or run the app
docs
tests
.github
README.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
walkthrough.md

# Utilidades de operacion y datos de origen: no participan en el build de la app
# ni se ejecutan dentro del contenedor. Mantenerlos fuera del contexto evita que
# lleguen a la imagen por descuido y acorta el build.
scripts/geo
scripts/*.py
scripts/db/*.py
